title Trends & Insights - Creative Production Pipeline (Flat 2-Level)

| User |
| Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
| research_agent (LLM) |
| ad_creative_agent (LLM) |
| Imagen 4 / Gecko (SDK) |
| Veo 3.1 (SDK) |
| focus_group_agent (LLM) |

| User |
start
:Provide Campaign Brief;

| Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
:TRENDS: Query BigQuery + YouTube API;
:Select top trends (deterministic);

| research_agent (LLM) |
:Read campaign context from state;
:recall_prior_insights (Memory Bank);
:google_search (5-7 primary + 3-5 follow-up);
:Compose cited research report;

| Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
:Capture report via _run_agent_and_capture;
:Persist combined_final_cited_report;

| ad_creative_agent (LLM) |
:Draft 10-12 trend-driven ad copies;
:Critique & select top 2 (save_select_ad_copy);
:Draft visual concepts per ad copy;
:Critique & select top 2 (save_select_visual_concept);

| Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
:Capture ad copies + visual concepts;

| Imagen 4 / Gecko (SDK) |
:Generate product ASSET image;
:Gecko fidelity score;
:Generate person ASSET image;
:Gecko fidelity score;
:Generate trend ASSET image;
:Gecko fidelity score;

| Veo 3.1 (SDK) |
:Generate commercial with ASSET references;
:Product ASSET + Trend ASSET -> Veo;
:Poll operation (wave-safe);

| focus_group_agent (LLM) |
:Analyze commercial video;
:Simulate 3-person focus group panel;
:Generate panelist portraits + testimonials;
:Go/No-Go decision (threshold 7.0);

| Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
:SAVE_REPORT: Compile branded PDF;
:Upload PDF to GCS + save as artifact;

| User |
:Review final campaign report;
stop
@enduml
